  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ambassador for Gender Equality (Global) 2023 - 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment covers the period of 2023 - 2025 to support the Ambassador&apos;s international engagement. The Ambassador for Gender Equality is Australia&#x2019;s lead advocate on gender equality and Australia&#x2019;s gender equality policy priorities. A core function of the Ambassador&#x2019;s role is protecting and promoting the human rights of women and girls, as well as of persons of diverse gender identities in Australia&#x2019;s foreign, trade and development policy.</narrative>
  </description>
